{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"La Tresse (The Braid)","Inde. Smita est une Intouchable. Elle rêve de voir sa fille échapper à sa condition misérable et entrer à l’école. Italie. Giulia travaille dans l’atelier de son père. Lorsqu’il est victime d’un accident, elle découvre que l’entreprise familiale est ruinée. Canada. Sarah, avocate réputée, va être promue à la tête de son cabinet quand elle apprend qu’elle est malade. Trois vies, trois femmes, trois continents. Trois combats à mener. Si elles ne se connaissent pas, Smita, Giulia et Sarah sont liées sans le savoir par ce qu'elles ont de plus intime et de plus singulier.",[4],"fatherhood",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":34,"characters":42,"roles":43,"awards":56,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_211","fr2023-211-la-tresse",{"native":10,"english":11},"La Tresse","The Braid",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-11-29",2023,"Fiction film",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Laetitia Colombani","laetitia-colombani",1976,0,"Female identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Comedy","Drama",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/241/36/271601/format_page/la-tresse.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K7imQ58Hxn4",{"native":2,"english":33},"",[35,37,40],{"country":24,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",{"country":38,"share":39},"Canada","Minority coproducer",{"country":41,"share":39},"Italy",[],[44,48],{"person":45,"role":47},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":46},[],"Director of the film",{"person":49,"role":55},{"id":50,"slug":51,"name":50,"birthYear":52,"deathYear":22,"gender":53,"nationality":41,"awards":54},"Mimmo Mancini","mimmo-mancini",1960,"Male identifying",[],"Minor actor/Cameo",[]],"uses":{"pa